  "browserStories": [
    "The signed browser loads a conversation and marks only the exact incoming messages from that peer read.",
    "A prepared Thinker question stays in the draft until Send and reaches the other participant as an ordinary message.",
    "A held reply from the old thread cannot appear in the new conversation or mark the old messages read.",
    "Explicit blocking clears the private thread, retires a held pre-block reply and refuses a new send from the other account.",
    "At 320px the owner can review and remove a block from the private list. A fresh conversation opens the preserved history.",
    "An explicit session refusal clears the conversation even when no local account event arrived.",
    "A committed block reply cannot reopen the conversation or publish a stale status after account retirement."
  ],
